/**
 * @file packages.dox
 * @brief Package list and ownership map.
 * @details This file is the source for the package documentation. Doxygen still
 * generates the native Packages menu from @c namespaces.html; @c custom.js
 * points that menu entry back to the generated @c packages_8dox.html file
 * reference so the package list stays under Packages while using this
 * maintained source.
 *
 * @section package_list_overview Overview
 *
 * InsightPC keeps the JavaFX desktop shell, preferences, UI builders, display
 * models, and OSHI integration in small packages with clear ownership. Use this
 * page as the primary navigation point for package-level API documentation.
 *
 * | Package | Responsibility | Typical changes |
 * | ------- | -------------- | --------------- |
 * | @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc | Application startup and JavaFX lifecycle. | Launcher, application initialization, main FXML loading. |
 * | @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.config | User settings, locale lookup, and AtlantaFX theme selection. | New preferences, resource bundle lookup, theme persistence. |
 * | @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller | Window-level controllers and UI lifecycle coordination. | Main window wiring, settings dialog actions, refresh coordination. |
 * | @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller.tab | Builders for the tabbed OSHI views. | New tabs, table/chart layout changes, tab-specific refresh logic. |
 * | @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.model | Small UI-facing value objects. | ComboBox display models and equality/display helpers. |
 * | @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.service | OSHI access and formatting utilities. | Hardware/OS queries, byte and uptime formatting, process data mapping. |
 *
 * @section package_list_rules Ownership rules
 *
 * - Keep direct OSHI calls in @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.service so UI code can
 *   stay focused on presentation.
 * - Keep JavaFX control construction in @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller.tab
 *   builders unless the control belongs to the main window shell.
 * - Keep persisted preferences and user-visible locale/theme state in
 *   @ref com.tlcsdm.insightpc.config.
 * - Add new package-level documentation here first so the Packages navigation
 *   remains stable and does not depend on generated namespace indexes.
 */

/**
 * @namespace com.tlcsdm.insightpc
 * @brief JavaFX application entry points for InsightPC.
 */

/**
 * @namespace com.tlcsdm.insightpc.config
 * @brief Theme, locale, and preferences configuration.
 */

/**
 * @namespace com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller
 * @brief FXML controllers that coordinate application windows and user actions.
 */

/**
 * @namespace com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller.tab
 * @brief Tab builders that render OSHI hardware, operating system, and process views.
 */

/**
 * @namespace com.tlcsdm.insightpc.model
 * @brief Small UI-facing domain models.
 */

/**
 * @namespace com.tlcsdm.insightpc.service
 * @brief Services that wrap OSHI and format system information for the UI.
 */
